---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms"
  fullTitle="Terms of Use — ChineseMenu"
  description="Terms of use for ChineseMenu: how our content may be used, medical and travel disclaimer, acceptable use, external links and how to contact us."
>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-5xl">
      Terms of Use
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">
      These terms govern your use of ChineseMenu (www.chinese-menus.com). By
      accessing this site you agree to the terms below. Last updated: August 2026.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Not professional advice</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          All content is provided for general informational and educational
          purposes only. It is not medical, legal, or travel advice, diagnosis or
          treatment. Always check dish ingredients for allergens with restaurant
          staff, and consult official sources for visa, health and safety guidance
          before you travel.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">How accurate is the information?</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          We work to keep dish names, pinyin and prices accurate and current, but
          menus, prices and romanization vary by region and change over time. We
          make no warranties about the completeness, accuracy or timeliness of the
          information on this site.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Acceptable use</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          You may freely use the point-to-order card and reference the site for
          personal travel. Do not republish large portions of the content without
          permission, and do not use the site for any unlawful purpose.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">External links</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Our pages link to third-party sites (such as UNESCO and Wikipedia) for
          source verification. We are not responsible for the content, accuracy or
          privacy practices of external sites.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Questions about these terms can be sent to
          <a
            href="mailto:contact@chinese-menus.com"
            class="text-accent-600 hover:text-accent-700">contact@chinese-menus.com</a
          >. Please also review our
          <a
            href="/privacy-policy/"
            class="text-accent-600 hover:text-accent-700">Privacy Policy</a
          >.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
